; A posting whose amount is written as an expression carries amount_expr
; but not POST_CALCULATED.  print must then keep the other posting's
; amount explicit (post_has_simple_amount returns false), whereas a plain
; two-posting transaction in one commodity has its second amount elided.

2024/01/01 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    ($10 * 2)
    Assets:Cash    $-20

2024/01/02 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $20
    Assets:Cash    $-20

2024/01/03 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $20
    Assets:Cash    ($-10 * 2)

test print
2024/01/01 Grocer
    Expenses:Food                          ($10 * 2)
    Assets:Cash                                 $-20

2024/01/02 Grocer
    Expenses:Food                                $20
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/03 Grocer
    Expenses:Food                                $20
    Assets:Cash                           ($-10 * 2)
end test
